bles are given to both player. Aim is to create a Straight Line either Horizontally or Vertically. When a Straight line is created, you claim a pebble from Opposition that must not belongs to a Straight line.  When all pebbles are placed on desk, single movements starts. You will get 4 options \"Left\"/\"Right\"/\"Top\"/\"Bottom\" to move your pebble to create a Straight line.  When you claim all pebbles from opposition then you will win the game.  I added \"Online\" feature for simple conversation with online users. But for that, you have to login with your google account. Enjoy :-)","topics":["authentication","firebase","game"],"score":284154,"global_rank":30982},{"name":"Tivcrmn/dotfiles","owner":"Tivcrmn","html_url":"https://github.com/Tivcrmn/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":null,"topics":[],"score":284148,"global_rank":30986},{"name":"stevejenkins/hardwarefreak.com-fqrdns.pcre","owner":"stevejenkins","html_url":"https://github.com/stevejenkins/hardwarefreak.com-fqrdns.pcre","stars":26,"forks":9,"watchers":16,"issues":2,"language":"Other","description":"Archive copy of Stan Hoeppner's Postfix PCRE bot spam killer (fqrdns.pcre)","topics":["bot-spam","dnsbl","dnsbl-rejections","pcre","postfix","postscreen","regular-expression"],"score":284147,"global_rank":30987},{"name":"sbeckeriv/rust-aha-cli","owner":"sbeckeriv","html_url":"https://github.com/sbeckeriv/rust-aha-cli","stars":3,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":3,"language":"Rust","description":"tui for aha in rust","topics":[],"score":284147,"global_rank":30988},{"name":"heckj/X5336","owner":"heckj","html_url":"https://github.com/heckj/X5336","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":"Experiment 5336 - Lindenmayer trees for iOS and macOS","topics":["swift"],"score":284144,"global_rank":30989},{"name":"yuxingch/Implicature-Strength-Some","owner":"yuxingch","html_url":"https://github.com/yuxingch/Implicature-Strength-Some","sta